<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury made no T-bill auction this week.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury made no T-bill auction this week.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian treasury has not carried out a treasury bill auction this week, treasury officials said.</p>
<p>It was the second week the treasury did not tap the internal debt market during August where financial market activities usually slow down.</p>
<p>The treasury's regular weekly auction is on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
